  "deleted_at": null,
  "sort_by_date": null,
  "tag_list": [],
  "updated_at": "2026-07-30T15:20:11.387Z",
  "published_at": "2026-07-30T15:20:11.373Z",
  "id": 203715425525031,
  "uuid": "c628cb70-1d6e-45b6-8f3d-0f97a37a2a9c",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "d4001abb-9df0-be92-7bd5-9865b040f12e",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "563efb61-d5d2-335e-8130-655cdbd887cb",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Chief Guest Professor Mwenda Ntarangwi;",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Members of the Board of Trustees;",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "President Firoz Rasul,",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Honoured Guests,",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Members of the Faculty,",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Graduates,",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Our sponsors and employers,",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Our dear family members and guardians,",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Ladies and gentlemen,",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Good morning",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "we celebrate the graduation of Doctors, Bachelor of Science nurses, specialized oncology nurses",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "and educationists. Guest of honor, these 80 graduates are so well prepared and are ready to make",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "a difference, radiate their excellence and compassion to the world and register many successes in",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "their careers. For one cannot go through Aga Khan University, an institution of distinction, and",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "fail to be associated with its values of quality, relevance, impact and access.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "I am deeply honored to be the valedictorian in this graduation ceremony, a proud product of the",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "pioneer higher diploma in oncology nursing class of the Aga Khan University. To all of us",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "graduating today Hongera for coming this far! We have indeed travelled a journey of sacrifice,",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "endless fears of failure, sleepless nights, tears, strict deadlines and highest expectations. The award",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "we receive today indeed reflects the success, achievement, teamwork and resilience that we have",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "shown throughout our stay at the Aga Khan University. We are grateful that we chose this",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "university and we were offered a chance that many only continue to dream of. We are appreciative",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "of His Highness the Aga Khan, the University Chancellor because we continue to enjoy the fruits",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "of His Vision. We could not have been in a better University.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Our gratitude goes to many people seated here and others who were not able to be with us today.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "People we have learnt from, who have taken us through the challenging period of training, have",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "supported us in numerous ways and corrected us in the most caring way. To our faculty we say",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "thank you. You have particularly taught us how to think, think and think again. You constantly",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "reminded us to contextualize our thoughts. You have celebrated many achievements with us.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Today you are still here with us celebrating our big achievement. In us, you have not only",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "disseminated knowledge in the most innovative ways, but have also given us many life skills.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Skills on how to manage time, lifelong learning, team work, responsibility, compassion and never",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "compromising standards of care.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "We cannot forget people who facilitated our journeying through the training for the period that",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "seemed the longest ever. To our sponsors, employers, families, spouses, children and friends, we",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "are grateful today. We recognize Kenya Hospices and Palliative Care association and the Oncology",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Nursing society who donated books to the oncology programme. The Johnsons and Johnsons who",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "offered scholarship to the Bachelor of Science in nursing program. You all made our continued",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "stay at the Aga Khan University bearable and we had the spirit to continue to the end.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Thank you to the non-teaching staff who supported us in immense ways, most notably the library",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "staff, administrative team, ICT team and Registrar's office. The ICT staff made sure that we knew",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "how to use the Moodle platform and had to start from the basics of the parts of a computer. The",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "library team had to make sure we knew how to navigate the library which is so well equipped that",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "we lacked no resource. The registrar's office that constantly reminded us that work with no play",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "makes Jack a dull boy, in this case a non performing student. Thanks to the Registrar's office that",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "several of us now know how to swim, are healthier and have in their closets certificates and medals",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "for having won in the sporting and karaoke competitions.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Guest of honor, allow me to give a brief account of our experiences at the Aga Khan University.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "We all joined this university with enthusiasm to improve ourselves, determined to change our",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "practice. The moment we begun the orientation period we realized that the kind of effort we had",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "to put in our studies was enormous. Throughout the various courses it came to our realization the",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "skills we had to learn. Long study hours became the norm, adjusting social life was not an option",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "and team work was an important skill one had to acquire. The learning \"how to think\" and asking",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"why\" is so engrained in my mind to date such that it took several attempts just to complete writing",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "this speech. Each one of us graduating here today holds dear special memories of skills learnt. For",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "example, the oncology cohort can attest that now they not only know how to care for cancer",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "patients but can write a newspaper article, a play script and even become play actors and directors.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "To all the graduates, I congratulate you all. I know that each of us has learnt a great deal in our",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "various disciplines and Aga Khan University has engraved in us great values. This university has",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "prepared us not only to face the future but also given us the instruments to shape our future and",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "the future of our people. Let us therefore strive to be the light for all those that look up on us and",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "make meaningful contributions to society. For this is the Mission of the Aga Khan University.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Thank you and may God bless you all.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Immaculate Wambugu, Higher Diploma Oncology Nursing, 2017",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
